Data Preprocessing
Image Resizing: All images resized to 224×224 pixels

Data Augmentation:

Random cropping (224→180→224)

Random horizontal flip (p=0.5)

Random rotation (±30 degrees)

Random grayscale conversion (p=0.1)

Color jittering

Normalization: ImageNet statistics (mean=[0.485,0.456,0.406], std=[0.229,0.224,0.225])

Model Architecture
Backbone: VGG16 pretrained on ImageNet (first 10 layers frozen)

Classification Branch:

3 fully connected layers (4096→1024→7)

Dropout (0.5) for regularization

Regression Branch:

3 fully connected layers (4096→512→2)

Tanh activation for [-1,1] range

Training Strategy
Loss Function: Weighted combination of Cross-Entropy (classification) and MSE (regression)

Optimizer: Adam with initial LR=0.0001

Learning Rate Schedule: Reduce on plateau (patience=5, factor=0.5)

Early Stopping: Patience of 10 epochs

Batch Size: 32

Epochs: 50 (with early stopping)

Results
Metric	Value
Classification Accuracy	62.3%
