Arousal MAE	0.148
Limitations
Dataset Bias: AffectNet primarily contains posed expressions

Class Imbalance: Some emotions (Disgust) have fewer samples

Subject Independence: Limited cross-dataset validation

Computational Cost: VGG16 backbone is computationally intensive

Real-world Performance: May not generalize to in-the-wild scenarios
